      "Faqs": "[{\"question\": \"What Reliability Standards and Certifications Does the RC0402FR‑07100KL Meet?\", \"answer\": \"This resistor is RoHS compliant and manufactured to meet industry reliability standards for surface‑mount components. Its proven thick‑film construction ensures stable electrical performance across common operating temperatures.\"}, {\"question\": \"What Is the Price and Availability of the RC0402FR‑07100KL at LCSCLLCSCCLCSCSLCSCCLCSC?LCSC\", \"answer\": \"The RC0402FR‑07100KL resistor is in stock at LCSC and available for immediate ordering. Competitive, tiered pricing supports both small‑quantity prototyping and high‑volume production purchases from a reliable electronic component supplier.\"}, {\"question\": \"Is the RC0402FR‑07100KL Compatible with Equivalent 0402 Resistors?\", \"answer\": \"Yes, the RC0402FR‑07100KL is compatible with most standard 0402 package resistors with the same resistance value and tolerance. Engineers should always confirm power rating and datasheet specifications before selecting an equivalent part from another supplier.\"}, {\"question\": \"What Applications Is the RC0402FR‑07100KL Commonly Used For?\", \"answer\": \"This SMD resistor is widely used in consumer electronics, industrial control boards, and portable devices for signal conditioning, voltage division, and pull‑up or pull‑down circuits. Its small size and stable performance make it ideal for space‑constrained electronic applications.\"}, {\"question\": \"What Are the Specifications of the RC0402FR‑07100KL Resistor?\", \"answer\": \"The RC0402FR‑07100KL is a 100 kΩ ±1% thick‑film chip resistor in a compact 0402 SMD package from YAGEO. This electronic component features ±1% tolerance, 62.5 mW power rating, and is designed for high‑density PCB layouts requiring precision resistance.\"}]",
